<section class="wx-mlp__sec">
<div class="wx-mlp__read">
<p>This guide turns that drift into a program: one approved list, one dispenser standard, one reorder that triggers itself, and a cost-per-use number you can defend in a Q4 budget review. It is written for the buyer who signs off across sites — procurement managers, operations directors, and franchise or multi-unit owners.</p>
</div>

