<section class="wx-mlp__sec wx-mlp__sec--final" id="run-one-standard-across-every-site-{{ uid }}">
<div class="wx-mlp__read">
<h2 id="run-one-standard-across-every-site-{{ uid }}">Run one standard across every site</h2>
<p>A multi-location program is not a bigger order. It is one approved list, one dispenser standard, one cadence, and a reorder that runs itself — repeated at every site with the same rules. Get those four in place before the budget closes and the next Q4 is a review, not a rebuild.</p>
